(86, 'tile', 'Cholene', 120.00, 'The \'Cholene\' tile is designed to meet the needs of modern living while maintaining classic elegance. With a carefully crafted minimalist, floral pattern, this tile brings a sense of artistry and personality to your floors or walls. With its stone classification, this tile stands out.', , '4ec29fdefefefdfc', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-12 07:50:01', '2025-11-08 06:13:17');
